{
  "verdict": "revision_required",
  "findings": [
    {
      "id": "CONCURRENCY-001",
      "severity": "blocking",
      "category": "requirement_coverage",
      "message": "Requirement 4 ('Run two projects concurrently in isolated workspaces with no shared session or ledger state') is not satisfied. All three concurrent campaign evidences show 'domainSeparation': 'SINGLE_DOMAIN_FAIR_INTERLEAVING', and limitations explicitly state 'A second independent quota domain was not proven.' A single shared domain means shared quota/session state, violating the isolation requirement.",
      "evidence": "R85-CONCURRENT-CAMPAIGN-1791757743077.json, R85-CONCURRENT-CAMPAIGN-1791759304205.json, R85-CONCURRENT-CAMPAIGN-1791759512621.json all show domainSeparation: SINGLE_DOMAIN_FAIR_INTERLEAVING"
    },
    {
      "id": "NATIVE-001",
      "severity": "advisory",
      "category": "test_reliability",
      "message": "Native persistence-upgrade verification shows flaky behavior: two of three runs failed with 'action[22] arrived=false != true' (persistence-upgrade-1791758390641.json and persistence-upgrade-1791758595391.json), only the third run passed (persistence-upgrade-1791758824636.json). While the migration-fault-campaign passed consistently, the persistence upgrade test should be stable for a verified milestone. The evidence packet includes failed runs without resolution.",
      "evidence": "native/persistence-upgrade-1791758390641.json (ok: false), native/persistence-upgrade-1791758595391.json (ok: false), native/persistence-upgrade-1791758824636.json (ok: true)"
    },
    {
      "id": "REVIEWER-001",
      "severity": "advisory",
      "category": "external_dependency",
      "message": "No production-eligible qualified REVIEWER route exists (five CLEARED-model attempts hard-failed or quota-exhausted; only qualified reviewer is DEVELOPMENT_ONLY NVIDIA trial correctly excluded at TERMS_ALLOWED). Autonomous runs fail closed at REVIEWER_FAILED. This is an external supply limitation, not an orchestrator defect, but it blocks end-to-end campaign completion.",
      "evidence": "limitations section; qualification files show REVIEWER: HARD_FAILURE or NOT_TESTED for all models"
    }
  ],
  "summary": "R85 evidence shows solid progress on preservation, qualification, fail-closed behavior, and native migration-fault verification. However, the concurrency requirement (isolated workspaces with no shared session/ledger state) is not met — all concurrent runs used a single shared domain. Native persistence-upgrade verification is flaky (2/3 runs failed). No production REVIEWER route exists (external blocker). Revision required to demonstrate true workspace isolation and stabilize native persistence tests."
}

